  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.29.0",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Keep host directory mounts in checkpoints on request and always when pausing by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1793\n* Sweep partial downloads abandoned for a day that no pull holds, at most hourly from the pull path, so cancelled pulls no longer leave partial blobs on a node forever. by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1794\n* Retry image pulls cut off by a dropped connection by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1798\n* Let a branch set labels on its child by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1799\n* Record machine lifecycle events in a local usage journal by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1780\n* Extract a zstd-compressed agent rootfs without a zstd program by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1801\n* Unpack image layers with GNU tar so symlinks keep their owners by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1805\n* Count a macOS process's CPU time in nanoseconds instead of mach ticks by @AlixANNERAUD in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1807\n* Stop `machine run -i` spinning forever on macOS when stdin is /dev/null by @RitikaxG in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1804\n* Record symlink owners on their parent directory in Linux host-extracted layers by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1809\n* Pin libkrun at the hinted free page zeroing fix, so a machine's later checkpoints, restores and branches skip memory the guest freed (2.4 GB to 0.26 GB in one test). by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1800\n* Pin libkrun at the symlink owner record, so .smolmachine symlinks keep their image owners on Linux hosts by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1810\n* Let a checkpoint capture reply once the artifact is held on the node and upload it later through POST /checkpoints/{key}/upload, so a caller no longer waits on a multi-gigabyte upload it does not need. by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1795\n* Add serve --guest-rollout-port by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1811\n* Mount the image seed behind every attached disk so exporting an image machine works when VMs run under their own uid by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1812\n* Mirror the pod netns gateway neighbor and route state into the guest by @quantike in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1781\n* Keep the local API socket private before publishing it by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1709\n* Avoid UID registry warnings when deleting unassigned VMs by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1708\n* Resolve guest hostnames in image VMs and restored clones by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1705\n* Preserve source VM CPU and memory when creating a pack by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1693\n* Let non-root image users write to fresh workspaces by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1688\n* Skip unused packed-layer device for VM-mode machines by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1678\n* Preserve installed agent rootfs when relocating machine state by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1667\n* Test the DNS allow-list helper against a fixed resolver, not the host's by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1665\n* Fail a boot for lack of progress, not for being slow by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1788\n* Make file operations target the filesystem exec uses and give each image run its own overlay by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1564\n* Hash a published cache disk while it uploads instead of before by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1814\n* Pin libkrun at the macOS symlink xattr fix, rebuild every bundled libkrun, and test packed symlinks by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1817\n\n## New Contributors\n* @RitikaxG made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1804\n* @quantike made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1781\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.28.1...v1.29.0",
